<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>椰奶西米露 · 沧林食品</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#f0e9e2;color:#2c2c2c;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf8f5;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}

.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#fdf8f0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;background:#fef2ee;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#f5ede5;border-radius:12px;color:#5a4f44}

.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#fef9f2;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0e9e2;color:#5a4f44}
.level-item.high{background:#C0392B;color:#fff}
.level-item.med{background:#E8D5B0;color:#5a4f44}

.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee5d8}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #f0ece6}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#5a4f44}
.story em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}

.index-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}
.index-item{background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center}
.index-item .label{font-size:9px;color:#b5aaa0}
.index-item .num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.index-item .desc{font-size:9px;color:#7a7269;margin-top:2px}

.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#3a322a}
.row .v{font-weight:600}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #ddd4ca;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B}
.roi{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.roi-b{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px}
.roi-b .d{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0}
.roi-b.c{background:#fdf2ee;color:#E8652D}
.roi-b.n{background:#fef6ec;color:#D4A574}
.roi-b.i{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}

.risk-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}
.risk-stars{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0;font-size:10px}
.risk-stars .on{color:#D4A574}
.risk-stars .off{color:#ddd}

.launch{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.launch span{padding:5px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44}

.scene-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.scene-item{padding:5px 12px;background:#f0f6ec;color:#4a7a3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}

.dpair{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.dpair-item{flex:1;min-width:140px;padding:8px 10px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;text-align:center}
.dpair-item .name{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#3a322a}
.dpair-item .price{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-top:2px}

.comp{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.comp-item{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:5px 8px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:6px}
.comp-item .tag{font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:auto;flex-shrink:0}
.comp-item .tag.adv{background:#f0f6ec;color:#5a8f3c}

.copy-box{padding:10px 14px;background:#f8f4ef;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8;margin-top:6px}
.copy-box em{color:#C0392B;font-style:normal}

.tip-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44}

.pay{padding:20px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fdf8f0,#f5ede5)}
.pay .lock-icon{font-size:28px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:4px}
.pay h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;color:#3a322a;margin-bottom:8px}
.pay ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:10px}
.pay ul li{font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;padding:4px 0 4px 16px;position:relative;line-height:1.6}
.pay ul li::before{content:"\2713";position:absolute;left:0;color:#5a8f3c;font-weight:700}
.pay .price-tag{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#C0392B;text-align:center;margin:10px 0 8px}
.pay .price-tag small{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#b5aaa0}
.pay .btn{display:block;text-align:center;padding:11px;background:#C0392B;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}
.pay .note{font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;text-align:center;margin-top:6px}

.ftr{text-align:center;padding:16px 22px;font-size:10px;color:#bbb}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">TP-07 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>🥥 椰奶西米露</h1>
  <div class="sub">甜品站消暑爆款 · 成本3.5卖10 · 摆摊 ✅ 夜市 ✅ 甜品站 ✅ 开店 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>椰奶醇香</span>
    <span>西米Q弹</span>
    <span>水果搭配</span>
    <span>清爽消暑</span>
    <span>低成本高毛利</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐 · 消暑必备</span>
  <span class="level-item med">新手可做</span>
  <span class="level-item med">夏季爆品</span>
  <span class="level-item med">利润爆</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    椰奶西米露是东南亚经典糖水，椰香浓郁、西米Q弹爽滑，搭配新鲜水果，每一口都是清凉的满足感。在甜品站、夜市、糖水铺，它一直是夏日消暑的绝对主角。<br><br>
    去年夏天在三亚后海村，看到一家椰奶甜品摊前排了二十多米的队。老板是两个95后女生，主打椰奶西米露加水果，一天能卖300多碗，下午四点就卖光收摊了。我蹲了三天，把她们的配方和流程摸了个透——<br><br>
    她们用的椰奶不是超市买的那种饮料，而是用椰子粉+全脂牛奶+炼乳调出来的，椰香浓郁还带着奶香，比纯椰浆好喝很多。西米是每天早上现煮的，煮到透明Q弹过冰水，口感超级好。<br><br>
    成本算下来令人惊叹：<em>一碗成本只要3.5元</em>——椰奶底+西米+水果+包装，全部用料加起来不到3.5元。卖10元，<em>毛利率65%</em>。如果走量大、搭配套餐，利润空间更大。<br><br>
    最关键的是：<strong>椰奶西米露是天然的"手机先吃"产品</strong>。雪白的椰奶，透明的西米，再加上芒果、火龙果、西瓜等五颜六色的水果丁，随便一拍就是朋友圈大片。在小红书搜"椰奶西米露"，几万条笔记都在教怎么做，热度极高。<br><br>
    而且操作极简——不用蒸不用烤，煮西米+调椰奶+切水果，三个人流水线作业，一小时能出100碗以上。可以说，<strong>椰奶西米露是甜品站夏季最值得做的现金流产品</strong>。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">高</div><div class="desc">投入约250元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">低</div><div class="desc">简单好上手</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">高</div><div class="desc">186%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">高</div><div class="desc">消暑款回头客多</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">10元/碗（350ml）</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本</span><span class="v">3.5元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单碗利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">6.5元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>椰奶底成本</span><span class="v">约1.5元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>西米成本</span><span class="v">约0.5元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>水果成本</span><span class="v">约0.8元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>包装成本</span><span class="v">约0.7元/碗</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50碗日利润</span><span class="v">325元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销100碗日利润</span><span class="v">650元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约250元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销30碗</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">1天</div><div>日销50碗</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">半天</div><div>日销100碗</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>季节影响</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">○</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">夏季最火，冬季可做热椰奶西米露</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>口味接受度</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">椰奶西米露认知度高，无需教育</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>竞争风险</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">○</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">椰奶品质+水果新鲜度拉开差距</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>出品一致性</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">●</span><span class="on">●</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span><span class="off">○</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">标准化操作，简单不易出错</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>煮锅 60元</span>
    <span>冰桶/保温箱 80元</span>
    <span>不锈钢盆 30元</span>
    <span>量杯 15元</span>
    <span>滤网 10元</span>
    <span>350ml碗+勺 0.7元/套</span>
    <span>椰子粉 25元/包</span>
    <span>西米 12元/袋</span>
    <span>炼乳 15元/瓶</span>
    <span>新鲜水果 时令价</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44">
    <span><strong>总投入：</strong>约250元</span>
    <span><strong>占地：</strong>0.6m长桌</span>
    <span><strong>人员：</strong>1-2人</span>
    <span><strong>上手：</strong>30分钟</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid">
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 夜市</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 学校门口</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 商业街</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 公园/景区</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 甜品站</span>
    <span class="scene-item">✅ 海滩/水上乐园</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">推荐搭配</div>
  <div class="story" style="font-size:12px;color:#5a4f44;margin-bottom:8px">单品卖10元 → 客单价10元，甜品组合购买力强</div>
  <div class="dpair">
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰奶西米露 + 烤肠</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价16元 · 客单价↑60%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰奶西米露 + 车轮饼</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价18元 · 客单价↑80%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dpair" style="margin-top:6px">
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰奶西米露 + 鸡蛋仔</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价20元 · 客单价↑100%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="dpair-item">
      <div class="name">椰奶西米露 + 冰粉</div>
      <div class="price">套餐价18元 · 客单价↑80%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">对标项目 & 竞争优势</div>
  <div class="comp">
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：奶茶店椰奶系列（15-22元）</span><span class="tag adv">10元定价，性价比碾压</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：便利店杯装糖水（8-12元）</span><span class="tag adv">现做现卖，椰奶品质远超工业品</span></div>
    <div class="comp-item"><span>对标：鲜果切（10-15元）</span><span class="tag adv">椰奶西米露有饱腹感，客单价更高</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:#5a4f44;line-height:1.8">
    ✔ 椰奶醇厚+西米Q弹，口感层次丰富<br>
    ✔ 白色椰奶+彩色水果，视觉冲击力极强<br>
    ✔ 成本仅3.5元（65%毛利率），利润空间充足<br>
    ✔ 椰奶粉+西米保质期长，损耗极低<br>
    ✔ 出餐30秒一碗，高峰期高效不压单<br>
    ✔ 水果可根据季节更换芒果/火龙果/西瓜/草莓等<br>
    ✔ 女性+小孩精准客群，消暑刚需复购率高<br>
    ✔ 操作门槛极低，新手30分钟上手
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">销售话术</div>
  <div class="copy-box">
    新鲜椰奶西米露，冰冰凉凉超好喝<br>
    一碗10块钱，椰奶是纯椰子粉加牛奶调的，超级香<br>
    西米QQ弹弹，水果都是早上新鲜切的<br>
    拍照发朋友圈，姐妹们绝对会问在哪买的<br>
    买两碗送一碗，跟闺蜜一人一碗刚刚好<br>
    见女生路过喊：<em>"椰奶西米露，清爽消暑，来一碗尝尝！"</em>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">避坑指南</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>椰奶底是关键：椰子粉+全脂牛奶+炼乳才是王道</strong>——千万别用超市那种椰奶饮料，兑了水味道太淡，卖不上价。最佳配方：椰子粉40g+全脂牛奶200ml+炼乳20g+冰水100ml，搅匀后冷藏。出来的椰奶醇香浓郁，比奶茶店的还好喝。如果想让口感更丰富，可以加10ml淡奶，奶香更足。成本只多0.2元，但顾客会觉得"这碗10块钱比奶茶店20块的还好喝"。</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <span><strong>西米煮法决定口感：开水下锅+焖够时间+过冰水</strong>——西米不需要一直煮，煮太久了会烂糊。水烧开后下西米，中火煮15分钟到只剩中间一点白芯，关火盖盖子焖10分钟直到完全透明。捞出来立刻过冰水，用滤网沥干，拌一点点糖水防粘。这样煮出来的西米颗颗晶莹饱满，Q弹有嚼劲。煮好的西米冷藏可放1天，建议每天早上煮当天用量。</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ <strong>水果切丁别太早，出摊前再切</strong>——芒果、火龙果、西瓜等水果切好后放太久会出水，把椰奶弄稀了，卖相也难看。正确做法：水果早上切好放冷藏保鲜盒，出摊前再分装。每碗放2-3种水果就够了，颜色岔开（芒果黄+火龙果红+西瓜红），视觉上丰富又好看。如果西瓜不是当季，可以换成哈密瓜、蜜瓜等绿色系水果，颜色搭配更出彩。</div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ ⚠️ <span><strong>冷藏展示+冰桶打冰底，保持出品温度</strong>——椰奶西米露是冷吃甜品，温度一上来口感差很多。摆摊一定要有保温箱或者展示冰柜，椰奶和西米分开放冷藏。出餐的时候先在碗底放西米，再放水果丁，最后倒入冰椰奶。如果天气太热，椰奶里可以加几块碎冰，口感更爽。注意：椰奶不要提前和西米混在一起，西米泡久了会吸水变软失去Q弹口感。</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ ⚠️ <span><strong>视觉陈列：分层展示+样品杯策略</strong>——在摊位最显眼的位置放一碗样品，椰奶倒到八分满，水果丁铺满表面，用LED灯打光。样品旁边摆上切好的芒果丁、火龙果丁、西瓜丁，让顾客看到水果的新鲜度。西米单独放在透明碗里展示晶莹质感。立牌写"椰奶西米露 10元/碗 清爽消暑"，字体要大。这一套陈列下来，路过的人几乎没有不停下看的。</span></div>
  <div class="tip-item">⚠️ ⚠️ <span><strong>冬天转型：热椰奶西米露+芋圆/红豆</strong>——冬天把冰椰奶换成热椰奶，西米用温水过一下，水果换成煮好的芋圆、红豆、紫米等热配料。热椰奶的香气比冰的还浓郁，冬天逛街的女生端着一杯热椰奶西米露幸福感拉满。成本基本不变，卖10元完全没问题。一冬一夏两个版本，一年四季都有生意做。</span></div>
</div>

